From 0fc5065f8991b581f18dae71cdfb679d20c98ef7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cliffhall <cliff@futurescale.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 23:49:31 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] fix: handle failed simulated sends; correct two comments

- everything's simulated logging and resource-update sends (immediate and
  interval) now log a rejected send instead of discarding it, so a closed
  transport cannot produce an unhandled rejection.
- everything's tsconfig.test.json comment no longer claims its build
  config excludes the tests.
- verify:dep-lockstep's wording now matches its rule: no two declarations
  may disagree; a single declaration anywhere is one range.

Refs #4864

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: cliffhall <cliff@futurescale.com>
---
 scripts/verify-dep-lockstep.mjs           |  9 ++++++---
 scripts/verify-dep-lockstep.test.mjs      |  2 +-
 src/everything/resources/subscriptions.ts | 16 +++++++++++-----
 src/everything/server/logging.ts          | 16 +++++++++++-----
 src/everything/tsconfig.test.json         | 10 +++++-----
 5 files changed, 34 insertions(+), 19 deletions(-)

